# versebus.R is kept byte-identical across torp/panna/pannamodels, and its own
# header documents the sync check as a plain `diff` between the copies. Under
# core.autocrlf that diff reported every line as changed whenever two checkouts
# disagreed on line endings, which made the check unusable. Pin it to LF so the
# documented command compares content.
R/versebus.R text eol=lf
